      "finalAnswer": "Mean=27, SD=11.49",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "Mid-points ($x_i$): 5, 15, 25, 35, 45.",
        "Assumed Mean $A=25, h=10$. $u_i = (x_i-25)/10$: -2, -1, 0, 1, 2.",
        "$f_i u_i$: -10, -8, 0, 16, 12. Sum = 10.",
        "Mean = $25 + (10/50) \\times 10 = 27$.",
        "$f_i u_i^2$: 20, 8, 0, 16, 24. Sum = 68.",
        "Variance $\\sigma^2 = h^2 [\\frac{\\sum f u^2}{N} - (\\frac{\\sum f u}{N})^2] = 100 [\\frac{68}{50} - (\\frac{10}{50})^2]$.",
        "$= 100 [1.36 - 0.04] = 132$.",
        "SD = $\\sqrt{132} \\approx 11.49$."
